            </tr>
            
            <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/60 transition bg-blue-50/30">
              <td class="p-3.5 font-bold text-slate-900">平价专线机场 (对照组)</td><td class="p-3.5 ">光速云 (GuangSu Cloud)</td><td class="p-3.5 ">合规订阅制透明收费 (低至 ¥8.25/月)</td><td class="p-3.5 "><span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">边缘无状态网关，不保留行为</span></td><td class="p-3.5 "><span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">无任何肉鸡风险</span></td><td class="p-3.5 "><span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">99.9% (IEPL 物理专线)</span></td><td class="p-3.5 "><span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 rounded font-bold">推荐首选 🛡️</span></td>
